⚡ Short Version (for the 600-character limit)
🦉 Leo is a multi-agent AI tutor: 4 specialized agents (Coordinator, Explainer, Quiz Master, Evaluator) work as a team to teach, quiz and grade students. Weak scores trigger a targeted re-teach, and the tutor remembers each student across sessions. Built with Python, CrewAI, Pydantic & Streamlit; works with OpenAI or Anthropic. Ideal for EdTech startups, course creators and training teams who want AI that teaches, not just chats.
